WEBVTT

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:02.258
AB: You heard people say,

00:23:02.282 --> 00:23:05.316
"I went into healthcare
to take care of people,

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:08.416
and there's all these things
in the way of doing that.

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:14.187
Either there's too many patients in the ER
that are waiting and piling up

00:23:14.211 --> 00:23:16.506
as I'm trying to spend time with this one,

00:23:16.530 --> 00:23:20.476
or my internal medicine appointments
are getting shorter and shorter,

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:22.736
or I'm spending all my time

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:25.846
in the electronic health
record after hours."

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:29.498
And so it became apparent

00:23:29.522 --> 00:23:32.407
that there's this value
conflict for people